    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d287-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d287-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Transmits memorandum on revision of U.S. policy on disarmament: test
                    suspension, reduction of military personnel, protection against surprise attack.
                    Secret. 19 pp. NARA, RG 273, Official Meeting
                    Minutes File, 350th Meeting, Tab A.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
